<title>POLAND: LDA Q1 net rises to PLN 0.3 mln.</title>
<headline>LDA Q1 net rises to PLN 0.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>LDA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.54 vs	0.41</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.54 vs	0.39</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.32 vs	0.23</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Lodzka Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  8.52 vs	7.59</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   7.02 vs	6.34</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.22 vs	0.16</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.03 vs	0.08</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.03 vs	0.10</p>
<p>    investment				 0.23 vs	0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
